{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265ZVgt2fMin1795107007.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>外長王毅表示，中俄美元首會晤是和平峰會，氣氛坦誠友好，富有建設性。</p><p></p><p>王毅在亞太經合組織APEC記者會表示，中俄美元首會晤是載入史冊的標誌性事件，意義重大，影響深遠，三國元首面對面，介紹各自的戰略意圖，同意要防止發生衝突對抗。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.WANG-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026hCymcU3wR41795107020.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>他指會後發布的《和平宣言》，核心是共同維護世界和平，促進大國關係戰略穩定，又指國際社會對和平及穩定的期盼，日益強烈，對大國加強溝通協調的呼聲，亦不斷高漲，今次會晤順應時代潮流，符合世界的期待。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T17:21:14.952433+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":209,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T14:59:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T21:49:03.804622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T17:14:29.236830+00:00","content_hash":"5061e1c1d2ce828f3b51ff97fa4d2b5a93dd23365348571d8c2c169f19aa2dac","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T17:21:14.952433+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}